{"id":"wb-6-896","name":"育德中学旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"育德中学旧址","text":"育德中学旧址，位于中国河北省保定市莲池区金台驿街86号，是第六批全国重点文物保护单位。此前在1983年2月被定为留法勤工俭学运动纪念馆所在地，1993年7月15日入选河北省文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%82%B2%E5%BE%B7%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90967184,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90967184","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fcd8fe59119f08c922015d53.jpg","title":"Former_Site_of_Yude_Middle_School_(20240719094446).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Former_Site_of_Yude_Middle_School_(20240719094446).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/Former_Site_of_Yude_Middle_School_%2820240719094446%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"N509FZ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Also the Diligent Work-Frugal Study Movement Museum with a plaque written by The Elder.","width":320,"height":213}}